Usage: awk [options] [--] 'pattern { action }' [file ...]
       awk [options] -f program [file ...]
-F, --field-separator SEP    Set FS
-v, --assign NAME=VALUE      Set a variable before BEGIN
-e, --source PROGRAM         Add AWK source
-f, --file FILE              Add source from a file
-i, --include FILE          Include a source once (AWKPATH)
-E, --exec FILE              Read program and end option processing
-b, --characters-as-bytes    Process input bytes
-S, --sandbox                Deny redirected input, output and external commands
-h, --help   -V, --version   -C, --copyright
